        </div>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-[#111827] block mb-1">Monastic Greyscale Design System</strong>
          Pure black-and-white visual weight: `#FFFFFF` canvas, `#111827` near-black actions, `#E5E7EB` / `#D1D5DB` hairline dividers, and `#6B7280` muted labels. Zero red or decorative color — validation errors and alerts use crisp monochrome typography and icons.
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-[#111827] block mb-1">Photo Collage & States</strong>
          The 3-photo collage pairs an asymmetric two-column grid with 16px corner radii using Haven's documentary craft photography (woven Aso Oke textile, brass table lamp, handmade ceramic mugs). All interactive form states are documented side-by-side.
